stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New
    New --> Paying : checkout
    state Paying {
        [*] --> Authorising
        Authorising --> Captured : approved
        Captured --> [*]
    }
    Paying --> check
    state check <<choice>>
    check --> Shipped : paid
    check --> Cancelled : declined
    Shipped --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    note right of Cancelled : refund if charged
